5.257.m:
On your shoulder is the Lord Brahmā; Sadāśiva rests upon your head;
Viṣṇu is situated in the region of your heart, and serpents are at the tip of your tail;
all the Vasus dwell in your dung; the Sādhyas are located in your urine;
all the sacrifices are in the region of your bones; the Kinnaras reside in your secret parts.
